From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:23:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): isolate live theme state between parallel unit tests

Keep runtime theme storage unchanged and give each unit-test thread a dark-initialized live table. Pin concurrent writes and fresh-thread defaults with deterministic tests.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2373
